		<node type="event_simple" id="7" tag="">
			<instruction>Locate a $[Resource.W.r_workbench_NameSingular]</instruction>
			<journal_entry>Now that you have located and used the $[Resource.W.r_workbench_NameSingular], it&apos;s time to craft a piece of $[Resource.A.r_armor_chain_mail_arms_NameSingular]. Locate the $[Skill.A.s_armorsmithing_NameSingular] icon, and double-click it. Then, locate and double click the Chain Mail icon and then the $[Resource.A.r_armor_chain_mail_arms_NameSingular] icon. Make sure you have the materials that are needed by checking the required materials list. If the list is too long, there will be a scroll bar handle which you&apos;ll need to scroll. If everything checks out, click on the large checkmark tobegin crafting. Once the crafting action is complete, the crafted item will be placed in your backpack. Each crafting skill is increased by crafting more items from each particular category and each recipe requires a particular skill level so that you are able to craft each item.</journal_entry>
			<tasks>
				<task type="interact_with_object" id="0" value="1" tag="An Interact With Object Task" resource_name="r_Workbench">
					<task_instruction>Press the Interact key while looking at the $[Resource.W.r_workbench_NameSingular]</task_instruction>
				</task>
			</tasks>
		</node>
		<node type="event_simple" id="8" tag="">
			<instruction>Craft one piece of $[Resource.A.r_armor_chain_mail_arms_NameSingular]</instruction>
			<journal_entry>That&apos;s it! You have successfully  crafted one piece of $[Resource.A.r_armor_chain_mail_arms_NameSingular]. If you are able to wear it do so and notice how it affects your stats via the Paperdoll.</journal_entry>
			<tasks>
				<task type="craft_item" id="1" value="1" tag="A Craft Item(s) Task" resource_name="r_Armor Chain Mail Arms" quantity="1">
					<task_instruction>Select and craft one piece of $[Resource.A.r_armor_chain_mail_arms_NameSingular]</task_instruction>
				</task>
			</tasks>
		</node>
		<node type="event_simple" id="9" tag="">
			<journal_entry>$[Resource.W.r_workbench_NamePlural] are scattered around all Agon, both in clan holdings and the safe zone cities. Most recipes can be crafted at a $[Resource.W.r_workbench_NameSingular], while Mastery Recipes might require a specific kind of $[Resource.W.r_workbench_NameSingular].</journal_entry>
